1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[Gon] Knuckle is… He's so…

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
He's so kind.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,000
[imperceptible]

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
[Gon] He doesn't have to teach me,
but still he keeps giving me advice.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
One day, you will leave Gon behind to die.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
you must stay out of Gon's life.

7
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,000
[singer singing in English]

11
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

12
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
INTEREST X AND X CURSE

13
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:34,000
[narrator] As they prepare at long last
to challenge Knuckle and Shoot to battle,

14
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Gon and Killua are deep in thought.

15
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Gon, just as I promised,
I'll give it my all.

16
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
From the very beginning!

17
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
[Gon] I can't compete with him in speed.

18
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Can't watch him.

19
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,000
I've got to feel him.

20
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Through my aura!

21
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,000
[grunts]

22
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
[Knuckle] Pretty confused, aren't you?

23
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
I just lent you some of my aura.

24
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:23,000
That's A.P.R. Amortizing Power Redirector.

25
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,000
He's just here
to announce the interest increase.

26
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:43,000
It's time now. You've accrued interest.

27
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:54,000
[Gon] It still doesn't hurt, not one bit.

28
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Of course, because I lent you 180 aura.

29
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:27,000
"180 aura" is simply
a numerical expression of life energy.

30
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:00,000
you'll be at a huge disadvantage.
Get it, fool?

31
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:05,000
It seems to me the max aura output
potential you can use through Ken

32
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,000
is about 1,800 aura.

33
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
When you're preparing for battle,

34
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:15,000
you usually expend approximately one aura
for every second.

35
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,000
that use a lot of Nen,

36
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:28,000
your rate of expended aura increases
by six to ten times.

37
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:32,000
The stronger your technique,
the more aura you use up.

38
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,000
That means
in an ordinary one-on-one fight,

39
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,000
you used up 12,000 aura.

40
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
[Gon whimpers]

41
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,000
[Knuckle] And you used Jajanken
four times.

42
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:01,000
Your AOP is around 1,800 aura.

43
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,000
But at the exact moment that
you yelled "Jan" to activate the attack,

44
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:09,000
the aura focused in your fist
was over 2,000.

45
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:14,000
That's due to its long windup
as well as your defensive sacrifice,

46
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
both of which are done
to focus aura in your fist.

47
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:22,000
A special provision covers such risks that
are often attributed to special attacks.

48
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:29,000
You spent around 5,500 aura in
your first three uses of Jajanken alone.

49
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:33,000
That puts your total consumed aura
at 17,500.

50
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,000
[Gon whimpers]

51
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,000
[Knuckle] As for the fourth shot,

52
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:40,000
right before your "Round 2" hit,
you ran out of energy.

53
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Actually, following through
with the technique

54
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,000
uses twice the activation amount

55
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:51,000
which means you used about 4,000 aura.

56
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:55,000
The amount of aura used
is the same for Rock and Paper.

57
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:59,000
However, Paper falls into a category
that you haven't practiced much,

58
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,000
so you used up 4,000 aura
on a weak attack.

59
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:15,000
So, your maximum POP is
approximately 21,500 aura!

60
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,000
[Gon groans]

61
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:23,000
That wasn't the kind of attack
I was expecting.

62
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,000
[Knuckle laughs]

63
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Not good with numbers, are you?

64
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:29,000
That's fine
because I'm just getting started.

65
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:33,000
-So you better listen, fool.
-Uh…

66
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Whenever your total accumulation
of borrowed aura, including interest,

67
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:40,000
exceeds your current remaining
Potential Aura Output Power…

68
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,000
you will go bankrupt.

69
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,000
But the interest
just keeps on accumulating.

70
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:59,000
It's been a few minutes
since we started this fight,

71
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,000
[Knuckle] Even with the 390 aura
I've lent you,

72
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,000
you're under 20,000.

73
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:49,000
Your debt will continue to grow and grow.

74
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,000
Okay, then what?

75
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:10,000
A.P.R. becomes IRS:
Individual Ren Suppressor.

76
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,000
And haunts the debtor for 30 days
while the target remains

77
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,000
-in a state of Zetsu.
-[evil laughter]

78
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:19,000
In short, you won't be able to use
any Nen at all.

79
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:23,000
But it's too late to back out now, fool.

80
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,000
[Gon] That's why
he didn't use this ability before.

81
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,000
He held back for my sake.

82
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,000
Which increases your loan by 30.

83
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,000
So what are you gonna do now?

84
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:18,000
And until your debt is repaid,
and in full,

85
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:22,000
I won't suffer even the slightest damage
from your attacks.

86
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,000
[A.P.R.] It's time.

87
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,000
You have accrued interest.

88
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,000
[Knuckle] Come at me, fool!

89
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:35,000
If you just stand there,
you'll go bankrupt anyway!

90
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,000
You managed to land more hits.

91
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:55,000
But ultimately you only repaid about
100 of the aura that you owe me.

92
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:08,000
You still haven't even paid off
half the accrued interest.

93
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:14,000
I won't let you launch Jajanken again.

94
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:18,000
Once your debt goes over 10,000,
my victory's assured.

95
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
It's time now. You've accrued interest.

96
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,000
[breathes deeply]

97
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,000
[grunts softly]

98
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:15,000
[Killua] What the hell is that?

99
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,000
You should know,

100
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:29,000
I take no pleasure at all
in hurting people.

101
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
That's precisely why I chose an ability

102
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:38,000
that only activates
whenever damage is inflicted.

103
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:42,000
It causes me to be more selective.

104
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,000
I only use it
on those I don't mind hurting.

105
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,000
However…

106
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,000
The two of you
helped me realize something.

107
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,000
There are times
that it becomes necessary to fight

108
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:13,000
as a sign of respect for your opponent.

109
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,000
[Killua] Three floating hands?

110
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:21,000
They're floating, but how?
What's his ability?

111
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Should I attack him first?

112
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,000
Calm down.

113
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:29,000
Use Gyo to check.

114
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,000
He's not using In.

115
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
Those three hands really are floating.

116
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:44,000
Which means,
more than likely, he's a Manipulator.

117
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,000
In other words…

118
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:57,000
[Biscuit] Every time you face an opponent
you perceive is stronger than you,

119
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:17,000
[Killua] I couldn't launch my attack.

120
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:21,000
My body, why can't I get it to move?

121
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,000
Is this my curse?

122
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,000
I wonder.

123
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:37,000
Stop. Don't think about it.

124
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,000
It's a bad habit.

125
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:42,000
His circumstances aside,
I must do my best to beat him.

126
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:46,000
Otherwise, I'm only insulting him.

127
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:53,000
[Killua] He's strong and fast.

128
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,000
He probably has me beat in every category.

129
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:04,000
[Illumi] That's right, Killua.
That's the way.

130
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:07,000
Don't fight an enemy you can't defeat.

131
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:15,000
Do you see your weakness?
You give up far too easily.

132
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Even against enemies of equal strength,
you think, "He's tough,"

133
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,000
You would run,
because you think like a loser.

134
00:18:56,000 --> 00:19:00,000
Forget it.
You know you'll never defeat him.

135
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,000
[Killua gasps]

136
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,000
My left eye.

137
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:41,000
But still, it's not good enough.

138
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:46,000
[Biscuit] You need to overcome
this bad habit right away.

139
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,000
Get way out of your comfort zone
and take a big risk for once

140
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,000
by challenging someone more powerful.

141
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,000
[Killua] I have to fight…

142
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,000
to win!

143
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,000
I'm blind on the left.

144
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:28,000
I've never truly fought,
and this is no different.

145
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,000
you must stay out of Gon's life.

146
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Huh?

147
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,000
[yelling]

148
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,000
[Killua] I won't run anymore.

149
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,000
Take this.

150
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,000
Electric shock?

151
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,000
[gasps]

152
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Now that's scary.

153
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,000
[heart beating]

154
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:17,000
[Killua] Never mind! Go!

155
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,000
[Illumi] Never over-pursue.

156
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,000
But how?

157
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,000
Stop.

158
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:41,000
How did you know?

159
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:48,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
